=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Kupipi} in {z:Heavens Tower} (Windurst Walls, HP #1) for a cutscene to receive {@k} {k:Star-crested summons}. Zoning after the last mission is not required.
* Speak to {n:Tosuka-Porika} in {z:Windurst Waters} HP #1 in the east wing of the **Optistery** (G-8) (Map 1) for another cutscene.
* Touch the **Worn Chest** in the storage room of the basement area of {z:Giddeus} on the second map at (F-6).
** Drop via **E** on Map 1.
** To enter the treasure room, click on the door, not the Yagudo guard.
** There is no preemptive cutscene. You will immediately be attacked from behind by a Yagudo Lookout (SAM).
*** Uses {p:Meikyo Shisui} around 66% HP and {p:Yaegasumi} around 33% HP.
*** The Yagudo Lookout has approximately 30k HP.
** There is a time limit of 15 minutes.
* Touch the **Worn Chest** again after the battle for a cutscene and to get the {@k} {k:Strange doll}.
** If you zone before touching the **Worn Chest**, you can return and check it to continue without fighting again.
* Return to {n:Tosuka-Porika} in {z:Windurst Waters} for a cutscene and your reward.

